## 10. Git and GitHub Workflow

The project was developed using Git and GitHub.

The development process included:

- Creating feature branches for separate tasks.
- Committing changes in small development stages.
- Pushing branches to GitHub.
- Creating Pull Requests.
- Reviewing and merging completed features into the main branch.

Examples of development work included navigation and theme functionality, page improvements, and GitHub API project integration.

